      ro: ["Suprafață: 825 km²", "Specii de arbori: 300+", "Primate: cimpanzei, maimuța colobus roșu", "Păsări: 360+", "Lemn: mahon", "Administrare: National Forestry Authority"],
      en: ["Area: 825 km²", "Tree species: 300+", "Chimpanzee population: 700", "Forest type: moist tropical", "Research station: Budongo Conservation Field Station", "Management: National Forestry Authority"],
